Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 18:44:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 292/307] !F (Terrain Plate) Add Stamp Height and Stamp Colour
 actions.

Replace the parked commit controls with Stamp Height and Stamp Colour actions
inside the Bake section. Stamping uses the displayed material appearance and
removes hidden options that could diverge from the preview.
---
